          ],
          "level": 1,
          "content": "Probe and ponder"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.083,
            0.706,
            0.727,
            0.743
          ],
          "content": "How might the loss of forest cover and changes in rainfall patterns lead to elephants to enter human farms and villages?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.083,
            0.743,
            0.727,
            0.796
          ],
          "content": "Imagine you are a tree in a dense forest. What kind of relationships would you have with water, sunlight, other animals, and other components of the forest?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.083,
            0.796,
            0.726,
            0.831
          ],
          "content": "Do you think the Earth can thrive without humans? Can humans survive without the Earth?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.083,
            0.832,
            0.68,
            0.868
          ],
          "content": "z If two kinds of birds compete for the same fruit, how might their way of living change over time?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.084,
            0.869,
            0.508,
            0.887
          ],
          "content": "z Can human actions cause natural disasters?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.084,
            0.89,
            0.327,
            0.909
          ],
          "content": "Share your questions"
        },
